                  <item row="2" column="0">
                   <widget class="QLabel" name="lbl_timbre_warm">
                    <property name="text">
                     <string>Red / orange</string>
                    </property>
                    <property name="toolTip">
                     <string>The timbre of strips whose dominant colour is red / orange:
Soft - the original pad sound: a sine with a little octave
Pure - a bare sine, the plainest possible
Brass - buzzing and full: every harmonic, falling off slowly
Reed - hollow, clarinet-like: odd harmonics only
Breath - hollow and mellow (a few odd harmonics), swelling once per beat
Glass - glassy: two and three octaves above the note, shimmering in sixteenths
Organ - organ-like: the note with its octave and double octave, throbbing in eighths
Pulse - the soft sound, throbbing in eighths</string>
                    </property>
                   </widget>
                  </item>
                  <item row="2" column="1">
