                    <property name="text">
                     <string>Equal loudness by</string>
                    </property>
                    <property name="toolTip">
                     <string>The curve that decides when two timbres count as equally loud.
K (used for the voice balance of the original) is nearly flat; A cuts the bass like the ear does at low volume.
If the richer timbres seem louder than the plain ones, choose Halfway or A (see README).</string>
                    </property>
                   </widget>
                  </item>
